<div class="page-header"><h2>Confirmar acción</h2></div>
<div class="brand-card p-4 mx-auto" style="max-width: 480px">
  <p>¿Está seguro que desea {{#if admin.isActive}}inactivar{{else}}activar{{/if}} al administrador <strong>{{admin.firstName}} {{admin.lastName}}</strong>?</p>
  <form action="/admin/administrators/{{admin._id}}/toggle" method="POST" class="d-flex gap-2">
    <a href="/admin/administrators" class="btn btn-ghost flex-fill">Cancelar</a>
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-brand flex-fill"><i class="bi bi-check2"></i> Aceptar</button>
  </form>
</div>
